WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.801 --> 00:00:05.776
A program is a list of commands. The turtle follows them from the top down.

2
00:00:06.777 --> 00:00:11.677
forward(100) moves the turtle 100 steps and draws a line.

3
00:00:12.727 --> 00:00:17.102
right(90) turns it a quarter turn. It does not move or draw.

4
00:00:17.854 --> 00:00:20.604
The next forward goes in the new direction.
